olap.MDXMondrianQuery:
SELECT {[Measures].[revenue], [Measures].[budget]}
ON COLUMNS, Hierarchize(Union({[pays].[All payss]}, [pays].[All payss].Children))
ON ROWS FROM [movies_cube]

